SCOPE OF THIS FILE

browser-use is the only upstream this package carries code from. The package
declares zero SwiftPM dependencies and vendors no source tree; the Chrome
DevTools Protocol client, the WebSocket transport, the page-side runtime
scripts other than the walker, the DOM serializer and the tool layer were
written for this package.

Two things a reader may recognise are not derived work and owe no attribution:
the RFC 6455 client in `Sources/CDP/LinuxWebSocketChannel.swift` is an
independent implementation of a published protocol, and `hashString` in the
walker is the textbook `h * 31 + c` string hash.
